1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,228
A landing page often mixes text, quotes, images, and other blocks.

2
00:00:05,228 --> 00:00:09,750
The Flow part lets editors build a page from widgets, and arrange them.

3
00:00:09,750 --> 00:00:14,036
In this video, we'll look at the part's settings, build a page, see

4
00:00:14,036 --> 00:00:16,620
the result, and try the Blocks editor.

5
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:24,915
A single body field gives an editor one block of text.

6
00:00:24,915 --> 00:00:26,886
A landing page needs more:

7
00:00:26,886 --> 00:00:30,581
a paragraph here, a quote there, an image beside them.

8
00:00:30,581 --> 00:00:34,830
Editors should arrange these blocks without asking a developer.

9
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:39,086
The Flow part adds a list of widgets to a content item.

10
00:00:39,086 --> 00:00:43,223
A widget is a content item whose type has Widget as its Stereotype

11
00:00:43,223 --> 00:00:46,039
setting, so each widget has its own fields.

12
00:00:46,039 --> 00:00:48,970
The widgets are saved inside the page itself.

13
00:00:49,720 --> 00:00:53,648
Every widget in a Flow part has a size, from 25% to 100%

14
00:00:53,648 --> 00:00:55,991
of the width, and an alignment.

15
00:00:55,991 --> 00:01:01,059
The editor chooses both for each widget, and the theme decides how widgets

16
00:01:01,059 --> 00:01:04,100
of different sizes sit next to each other.

17
00:01:04,850 --> 00:01:09,861
The Flows feature provides the Flow part, and depends on the Widgets feature.

18
00:01:09,861 --> 00:01:12,760
You enable features under Tools, Features.

19
00:01:12,760 --> 00:01:17,590
The Blog recipe enables both, and the site in this video uses that recipe.

20
00:01:18,340 --> 00:01:23,694
The recipe also creates widget types such as Paragraph, Blockquote, Image, and Raw

21
00:01:23,694 --> 00:01:26,675
Html, and a Page type that has a Flow part.

22
00:01:26,675 --> 00:01:32,090
The Container widget has a Flow part of its own, so widgets can hold other widgets.

23
00:01:36,294 --> 00:01:41,127
Parts are added to a content type under Design, Content Definition, Content Types.

24
00:01:41,127 --> 00:01:42,994
Let's open the Article type.

25
00:01:43,449 --> 00:01:44,995
Let's choose Add Parts.

26
00:01:44,995 --> 00:01:48,460
It lists the parts that can be attached, and Flow is one of

27
00:01:48,460 --> 00:01:50,219
them, with its description.

28
00:01:50,671 --> 00:01:54,746
Add & Configure attaches the part, and opens its settings.

29
00:01:54,746 --> 00:02:00,031
The Page type has the Flow part, so let's open Page, and choose Edit on Flow.

30
00:02:00,488 --> 00:02:04,628
Restrict Content Types limits the widget types that editors can add.

31
00:02:04,628 --> 00:02:09,608
When no box is checked, every content type with the Widget stereotype is available.

32
00:02:10,064 --> 00:02:14,315
Collapse Contained Items folds the widgets when the edit form loads.

33
00:02:14,315 --> 00:02:16,784
Editors can expand each widget again.

34
00:02:17,250 --> 00:02:21,715
The list under What default alignment should be used sets the alignment of

35
00:02:21,715 --> 00:02:23,166
each widget you add.

36
00:02:23,166 --> 00:02:26,180
Without a choice, widgets you add are justified.

37
00:02:26,722 --> 00:02:31,521
The last setting, What type of editor should be used, offers Standard and Blocks.

38
00:02:31,521 --> 00:02:35,382
Let's keep Standard for the page, and look at Blocks at the end.

39
00:02:39,663 --> 00:02:41,323
Let's build a page.

40
00:02:41,323 --> 00:02:47,033
Open Content, Content Items, choose New, and then Page, to open the page editor.

41
00:02:47,593 --> 00:02:52,146
The editor has a Title, a Permalink, and the Flow part with its description.

42
00:02:52,146 --> 00:02:56,699
Let's type the title Hillside Bakery, and leave the Permalink empty, so that

43
00:02:56,699 --> 00:02:58,753
it is generated from the title.

44
00:02:59,217 --> 00:03:03,361
The plus button under Flow lists the widget types that the part allows.

45
00:03:03,361 --> 00:03:06,107
Let's choose Paragraph, and write a sentence.

46
00:03:06,567 --> 00:03:11,177
Let's add a Blockquote the same way, and write a short quote in its text box.

47
00:03:11,629 --> 00:03:15,091
Hover over a widget's header to see its controls.

48
00:03:15,091 --> 00:03:17,420
The size button starts at 100%.

49
00:03:17,420 --> 00:03:22,959
Let's set both the Paragraph and the Blockquote to 50%, and they sit side by side.

50
00:03:23,430 --> 00:03:28,519
The alignment button offers Left, Center, Right, Justify, and Inherit.

51
00:03:28,519 --> 00:03:30,460
Let's center the quote.

52
00:03:30,934 --> 00:03:35,664
The arrow in a widget's header collapses the widget, leaving only the header.

53
00:03:35,664 --> 00:03:38,854
Let's collapse the Paragraph, and expand it again.

54
00:03:39,340 --> 00:03:43,346
To change the order, drag a widget by the handle at the left of its header.

55
00:03:43,346 --> 00:03:45,720
Let's drag the quote before the paragraph.

56
00:03:46,207 --> 00:03:50,228
The plus button in a header inserts a widget above that one.

57
00:03:50,228 --> 00:03:53,457
Let's insert a Raw Html widget above the quote.

58
00:03:53,915 --> 00:03:57,993
The trash button removes a widget, after a confirmation.

59
00:03:57,993 --> 00:04:01,545
Let's remove the Raw Html widget, and choose Ok.

60
00:04:02,017 --> 00:04:06,231
Publish saves the page with all its widgets, and returns to the list

61
00:04:06,231 --> 00:04:08,907
of content items, where the page appears.

62
00:04:13,104 --> 00:04:17,199
On the site, the quote and the paragraph appear side by side, each

63
00:04:17,199 --> 00:04:20,384
taking half of the width, with the quote centered.

64
00:04:20,384 --> 00:04:25,104
The theme provides these columns, and the order is the one set in the editor.

65
00:04:29,321 --> 00:04:32,652
The Blocks editor replaces the plus menu with a dialog.

66
00:04:32,652 --> 00:04:36,421
Let's choose Blocks in the settings of the Flow part, and save.

67
00:04:36,896 --> 00:04:39,517
Let's edit the Hillside Bakery page again.

68
00:04:39,517 --> 00:04:43,610
The plus button opens the Select Widget dialog, with a search box and

69
00:04:43,610 --> 00:04:45,466
a card for each widget type.

70
00:04:45,922 --> 00:04:50,873
Categories on the left filter the cards, and a thumbnail can illustrate each one.

71
00:04:50,873 --> 00:04:56,052
A widget type gets both from the Category and Thumbnail settings of its content type.

72
00:04:56,506 --> 00:05:00,234
Let's search for quote, and choose Add on the Blockquote card.

73
00:05:00,234 --> 00:05:04,236
The dialog closes, and the widget is added after the other widgets.

74
00:05:06,236 --> 00:05:10,591
The Flow part turns a page into a list of widgets that editors

75
00:05:10,591 --> 00:05:13,281
add, fill in, size, align, and move.

76
00:05:13,281 --> 00:05:14,946
Thanks for watching.

